    "post_rendered": "For any real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b36cc69f571292b8fde1ca10fd68e8902ac63f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x , y ,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" > prove that :<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0093082431d522a5a983a1636a09e59043ff67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"$$(x+y+z)^2 + \\sum_{cyc}{\\frac{(x+y)(y+z)}{1+|x-z|}} \\ge xy+yz+zx$$\"  width=\"387\" height=\"49\" ><br>\n<i>Proposed by Navid Safaei</i>",
